        "Content": "<ul><li> A-rated four-bedroom semi-detached home</li><li> Beautifully presented throughout</li><li> Small, highly regarded development</li><li> Spacious open-plan kitchen/dining/family room</li><li> Generous separate living room</li><li> Principal bedroom with en-suite and private balcony</li><li> Attractive countryside views</li><li> Private, low-maintenance rear garden</li><li> Off-street parking and gated side access</li><li> Convenient to Wicklow Town and local schools</ul>"
